## 11. Portal UX

**FACT:** Protected paths — `apps/portal/middleware.ts:23-25`. Entitlement gating pattern — `apps/portal/app/me/home/page.tsx:6-10`.

### 11.1 `/me/tickets` — List

| Aspect | Design |
| ------ | ------ |
| Desktop | Card list; filter chips (status); PageHeader + «درخواست جدید» |
| Mobile | Same cards; FAB «درخواست جدید» bottom-right (RTL: bottom-left) |
| Primary CTA | «درخواست پشتیبانی جدید» → `/me/tickets/new` |
| Status display | Chip: icon + Persian label + `aria-label` (not color alone — WCAG) |
| Empty | «هنوز درخواستی ثبت نکرده‌اید» + CTA |
| Loading | Skeleton cards (portal wallet pattern) |
| Error | «بارگذاری ناموفق» + «تلاش مجدد» |
| Pagination | Infinite scroll or «بارگذاری بیشتر» with cursor |
| Viewer | Same list; hide create CTA; show read-only banner |

### 11.2 `/me/tickets/new` — Create

| Aspect | Design |
| ------ | ------ |
| Desktop | Single-column form max-width 640px |
| Mobile | Full-width; sticky submit bar |
| Fields | category (select), subject, body (textarea), optional tour link |
| Validation | Inline errors; `aria-invalid` + `aria-describedby` (WCAG 3.3.1) |
| Submit | Disabled while pending; idempotency key client-generated UUID |
| Cancel | «انصراف» → confirm if dirty |
| Error | Field-level + summary |

### 11.3 `/me/tickets/[id]` — Detail

| Aspect | Design |
| ------ | ------ |
| Desktop | Status banner top; message timeline; composer bottom |
| Mobile | Timeline scroll; fixed composer |
| Timeline | Public messages only; RTL bubbles (member end-aligned) |
| Resolved | Banner «این درخواست حل شده» + composer + «بازگشایی» |
| Closed | Banner «بسته شده»; no composer; «برای پیگیری درخواست جدید بسازید» |
| Reply | Textarea + «ارسال»; 409 → toast |
| Keyboard | Composer focusable; Enter does not submit (Shift+Enter newline) |

---

## 12. Operator UX

**FACT:** Booking inbox uses split-pane + Sheet on mobile — `bookings-command-center-shell.tsx:16-17`, `OperatorEmptyState`, `PageHeader`.

### 12.1 `/tickets` — Inbox

| Aspect | Design |
| ------ | ------ |
| Desktop | Split-pane: table/list left (40%), detail right (60%) |
| Mobile | List full screen → tap opens detail Sheet/full page |
| Layout choice | **Table desktop** (dense columns: status, priority, subject, requester, updated) |
| Filters | Status, priority, category, assignee, unassigned toggle |
| Search | `q` on subject + requester mobile |
| Primary CTA | None global; row click opens detail |
| Unread | Bold row when `lastActivityAt > operatorLastSeenAt` (client state MVP) |
| Empty | `OperatorEmptyState` «تیکتی یافت نشد» |
| Loading | `OperatorSkeleton` |
| Error | Banner + retry |
| Pagination | Cursor «بارگذاری بیشتر» |

### 12.2 `/tickets/[id]` — Detail (or right pane)

| Aspect | Design |
| ------ | ------ |
| Header | Subject, status chip, priority, assignee dropdown |
| Context sidebar | Requester name/mobile, related tour link, registration link |
| Timeline | Public + internal (internal: muted background + «یادداشت داخلی» badge) |
| Composer tabs | «پاسخ به عضو» \| «یادداشت داخلی» |
| Assignment | Dropdown of tenant operators (admin/owner) |
| Status actions | Dropdown: open, pending_member, resolved, closed |
| Reopen | Button when `closed` |
| Resolved/closed | Disable public reply on `closed`; warn on `resolved` |

---

## 13. RTL and accessibility

### RTL

**DECISION:**

- `dir="rtl"` on portal/web ticket layouts
- Timeline: member messages align start (right in RTL); operator align end
- Icons: use logical properties (`margin-inline-start`) via design tokens
- Dates: display with `localized-calendar` / `next-intl` fa-IR

### Accessibility (WCAG 2.2)

| Requirement | Implementation |
| ----------- | -------------- |
| Focus visible (2.4.7) | Design token focus ring on all interactive elements |
| Focus appearance (2.4.13) | 3:1 contrast on focus indicator |
| Error identification (3.3.1) | Text errors linked via `aria-describedby` |
| Status not color-only | Icon + text on every status chip |
| Keyboard | Tab order: filters → list → detail → composer |
| Labels | `aria-label` on icon-only buttons |

**Research:** Nielsen #1 Visibility of system status → status banner always visible on detail pages.

---

## 14. Audit and observability

| Event | TicketEvent | AuditEvent |
| ----- | ----------- | ---------- |
| Ticket created | `created` | `ticket.created` |
| Status change | `status_changed` | `ticket.status_changed` |
| Assign | `assigned` | `ticket.assigned` |
| Priority change | `priority_changed` | `ticket.priority_changed` |
| Reopen | `reopened` | `ticket.reopened` |

**DECISION:** Log structured fields: `tenantId`, `ticketId`, `actorUserId`, `traceId` (from ALS — `bind-request-context.ts:101-102`).

**OUT OF SCOPE MVP:** Outbox notification events (Phase 7).

