## 16. Rollout and rollback

### Phased implementation

See §17 (phase numbering aligned to user request).

### Rollout

1. Deploy schema + RLS with feature disabled (manifest `supported: false`).
2. Enable per workspace in manifest `workspaceTicketing.supported: true`.
3. Portal nav item gated by entitlement (like wallet).
4. Operator nav item gated by `operator.tickets.read` + theme flag.

### Rollback

- Disable manifest flag → UI hides; API returns **404** `TICKET_MODULE_DISABLED`.
- Schema rollback: forward-only migration; do not drop tables in production rollback — disable access only.

---

## 17. Implementation phases

### Phase 1 — Contracts and domain types

| | |
|-|-|
| **Scope** | `ticketing-http-contracts`, `ticketing-core` types, Zod, error codes, lifecycle pure functions |
| **Non-goals** | DB, HTTP, UI |
| **Packages** | `packages/ticketing-http-contracts`, `packages/ticketing-core` |
| **Tests** | Unit: transitions, permissions, validation |
| **Acceptance** | All lifecycle matrix cases pass unit tests |
| **Risks** | Doc-gate / guard-docs on new packages |
| **Rollback** | Remove packages; no DB impact |

### Phase 2 — Prisma model and PostgreSQL RLS

| | |
|-|-|
| **Scope** | `Ticket`, `TicketMessage`, `TicketEvent` models + RLS SQL |
| **Non-goals** | API routes |
| **Files** | `schema.prisma`, `infra/sql/*_ticket_rls.sql`, migration |
| **Tests** | `ticketing-persistence.postgres.spec.ts` |
| **Acceptance** | RLS ENABLE+FORCE; cross-tenant deny |
| **Risks** | Migration conflict with parallel work |
| **Rollback** | Disable routes; tables remain empty |

### Phase 3 — Core domain and lifecycle rules

| | |
|-|-|
| **Scope** | `TicketingService`, repositories (Prisma only), assignee validation |
| **Tests** | Service integration with postgres |
| **Acceptance** | Create → message → resolve → reopen flows |
| **Rollback** | Feature flag off |

### Phase 4 — HTTP API and authorization

| | |
|-|-|
| **Scope** | `ticketing-http`, `apps/api` wiring, operator surfaces, memory-driver guard |
| **Tests** | HTTP spec per endpoint; auth matrix |
| **Acceptance** | Member + operator paths green; viewer 403 on mutate |
| **Rollback** | Remove route registration |

### Phase 5 — Member Portal

| | |
|-|-|
| **Scope** | `/me/tickets/*`, BFF `/api/me/tickets/*`, nav, entitlement |
| **Tests** | Portal unit + smoke E2E |
| **Acceptance** | Member creates ticket; appears in operator inbox (Phase 6) |
| **Rollback** | Hide nav; BFF 404 |

### Phase 6 — Operator Inbox

| | |
|-|-|
| **Scope** | `/tickets` web, split-pane, filters |
| **Tests** | Web unit + playwright |
| **Acceptance** | E2E member → operator reply |
| **Rollback** | Hide operator nav |

### Phase 7 — Notifications, attachments, SLA, reporting

| | |
|-|-|
| **Scope** | Outbox events, MinIO attachments, SLA, search |
| **Non-goals** | Required for MVP launch |
| **Rollback** | Independent feature flags per sub-feature |

