## 18. Risks

| ID | Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
| -- | ---- | -------- | ---------- |
| R1 | Memory driver in dev hides RLS bugs | P1 | Forbid ticketing on memory; postgres required |
| R2 | Viewer role confusion on Portal | P2 | Read-only banner + 403 on mutate |
| R3 | Category codes drift across workspaces | P2 | Manifest validation at create |
| R4 | Operator inbox perf at scale | P2 | Indexes §7.1; cursor pagination |
| R5 | Persian RTL timeline bugs | P2 | Visual regression tests |
| R6 | Doc-first covenant blocks API PR | P2 | This document satisfies Phase 0.5 |
| R7 | `workspace-membership` stub | P1 | Assignee check via `UserTenant` query directly |

